    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "I dream of oaken soldiers once more. Who is this army that sprawls before me? I feel a stiffening in my limbs as I wake. I think The Dust is getting to me. I require Drysap treatment once a week now, and even then it does little to ease my discomfort.",
    "value": "我又梦见了那些橡木战士。这支展现在我面前的军队，究竟是何方神圣？醒来时，我感到四肢僵硬。我想是尘狱开始侵蚀我了。我现在每周都需要一次干树汁治疗，即便如此，它也几乎无法缓解我的不适。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Today I killed a prisoner. I pushed him down the stairs on the way to dinner. The other guards cheered and hooted, but I felt no such pleasure. The thrill of the hunt is gone from me. I should set a torch to them and see how well they hunt then.",
    "value": "今天我杀了个囚犯。在去吃饭的路上，我把他推下了楼梯。其他守卫都在欢呼叫好，我却感受不到丝毫那样的快意。狩猎的刺激感已离我而去。我真该点把火，看看到了那时候，他们还能不能狩猎得那么起劲。"
  }
